  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the resilience of the local food system to natural disasters and climate change with a nutritional approach for supplying social safety nets</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1)Strengthen resilience to climate changes and shocks 2)Enhance the resilience of local food systems 3) Increase access and consumption of vulnerable population to a diversified and healthy diet</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innovative capacity building program for small farmers contributes to food security, promotes environmentally friendly farming methods to strengthen resilience to climate change, improves the quality of life of local residents, reduces poverty, and contributes to improving children&apos;s nutrition&#xC9C0;&#xC5ED; &#xC2DD;&#xD488; &#xC2DC;&#xC2A4;&#xD15C; &#xAC15;&#xD654;
